meta {
  name: auth
}

docs {
  TRZ-09 against a running API with the synthetic fixture (make seed-synthetic) and DEMO_MODE=true.
  Run the folder in order. The analyst password is read from bruno/.env (ANALYST_DEMO_PASSWORD),
  which git ignores; copy it from the project .env.

  CA5 (15 idle minutes on the real clock) is not here: it needs the clock moved, and
  tests/integration/test_auth.py covers it.
}
